  "decision_conditions": [
    "Consent is refused for the following works: T1 (Eucalyptus) - remove tree including the stump.\r\n\r\nThe tree is prominently visible from both St Margarets Road and Aldersbrook Road, contributing positively to the character and visual amenity of the surrounding area.\r\n\r\nThe applicant has not provided evidence of structural or physiological decline. The only concern raised is a single branch drop, with no clarification on whether this was deadwood or a result of seasonal conditions such as the recent dry summer. This does not constitute sufficient justification for removal.\r\n\r\nThe size of the tree alone is not a valid reason for its removal."
